            "review_title": "Review at Cheese Pasta",
            "review_text": "Tuấn Vũ Đ\n17 contributions\n0\nThe price is not too high, you can eat at noon.\nMar 2026 • Friends\nNear the economic district there are some shops too okela, this cheese shop is also busy. Central area + has a cooling machine + nice food that costs an average of 65k / dish, also soft ha\nIn the figure is egg cream meat salt 65k cheese pill, vs salad fruit grape vinegar 39k Asian. Few dishes, women eat but men don’t eat. The fever on this side is quite easy to eat, the kitchen is Vietnamese, so it is not too fat and smells like salt eggs. The meat is too cold, not much cheese. Salad is fine and easy to eat. The price isn’t too high, you can eat at noon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 28, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
